03)----Projection: pdm_outer.id, __correlated_sq_1.mark, __correlated_sq_2.mark
04)------LeftMark Join:  Filter: pdm_outer.k = __correlated_sq_2.k IS NULL
05)--------LeftMark Join:  Filter: pdm_outer.k = __correlated_sq_1.k IS TRUE
06)----------TableScan: pdm_outer projection=[id, k]
07)----------SubqueryAlias: __correlated_sq_1
08)------------TableScan: pdm_inner projection=[k]
09)--------SubqueryAlias: __correlated_sq_2
10)----------TableScan: pdm_inner projection=[k]

